heptagon-ramsey-lean: Pálvölgyi's seven-point cyclic set is not Ramsey, so Graham's conjecture as
stated in formal-conjectures is false; and Theorem A.3 of arXiv:2609.23327, through OpenAI's
classification of finite Euclidean Ramsey configurations
